# SolCafe Codebase Audit Report

This report presents a production-level audit of the SolCafe coffee shop mobile application codebase. The review covers app architecture, user flows, databases, security, performance, code quality, UI/UX, and dependencies.

---

## 1. Executive Summary & Health Scores

The SolCafe application has a solid styling foundation with custom themes and basic screen flows. However, several **critical issues** in data structures, navigation flows, database queries, and security stand in the way of production readiness.

