## 3. High & Medium Severity Issues

### Data Inconsistency: Profile Name Updates
* **Affected File:** [edit_profile.dart](file:///c:/solcafe/lib/user%20authentication/edit%20profile.dart) & [sign_up.dart](file:///c:/solcafe/lib/user%20authentication/sign%20up.dart)
* **Description:** Registration writes the name key to Firestore as `username`, but profile updates write to `name`. Furthermore, updating the profile updates Firestore but does not call `user.updateDisplayName()` in Firebase Auth, which is what the Drawer and My Account screens read.
* **Impact:** The profile update feature is broken. Edited names are stored in a mismatched key and will not show up in the Drawer or Account screen.
* **Solution:** Keep key names consistent (e.g. `'name'`) and sync with Firebase Auth display name:
  ```dart
  await user.updateDisplayName(name.text);
  await FirebaseFirestore.instance.collection("users").doc(user.uid).update({"name": name.text});
  ```

### Broken Search: Local Asset Network Call Crash & Missing Interaction
* **Affected File:** [custom_saerch.dart](file:///c:/solcafe/lib/working%20with%20search%20bar/custom%20saerch.dart)
* **Description:** Search result images are loaded via `Image.network(image)` even though the app utilizes local assets (e.g. `assets/images/...`), which causes a crash. The search result tiles also lack an `onTap` property.
* **Impact:** Search results crash during image rendering, and even if they render, users cannot tap to view or order the item.
* **Solution:** Replace `Image.network` with `Image.asset` for local images and implement an `onTap` to push `Viewindetail()`.

### Missing Wallet UI & Blocked Payment Flows
* **Affected Files:** [All_payments.dart](file:///c:/solcafe/lib/working%20with%20payment/All%20payments.dart) & [payment_method.dart](file:///c:/solcafe/lib/working%20with%20payment/payment%20method.dart)
* **Description:** The "Payment" bottom nav tab is completely mocked with a static string. Additionally, paying via UPI or Net Banking inserts data into Firestore but leaves the user stuck on the payment selection page without feedback.
* **Impact:** The payments ledger is non-functional. Payment selection flows hang and cause user confusion.
* **Solution:** Implement a `StreamBuilder` for payment history in `Allpayments` and route to an order success screen upon completing net-banking or UPI orders.

### Non-Atomic Order Database Writes
* **Affected Files:** [cash_on_delivery_model.dart](file:///c:/solcafe/lib/working%20with%20payment/cash%20on%20delivery%20model.dart) & [credit_card_ui.dart](file:///c:/solcafe/lib/working%20with%20payment/credit%20card%20ui.dart)
* **Description:** Order placement writes to `making_orders`, `ordered items`, and `payments` collections as individual, independent await queries.
* **Impact:** If a network drop occurs mid-execution, database entries become desynchronized, leading to missing invoices or unrecorded items.
* **Solution:** Utilize a `WriteBatch` to perform atomic database updates:
  ```dart
  WriteBatch batch = FirebaseFirestore.instance.batch();
  batch.set(orderRef, orderData);
  batch.set(itemRef, itemData);
  batch.set(paymentRef, paymentData);
  await batch.commit();
  ```

