## 5. UI/UX Analysis

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[View In Detail Screen] -->|Click Add to Cart| B(AddToCartPage)
    B -->|Click Add to Cart Again| C{Add to Cart Action}
    C -->|Wait 3 Seconds| D[CartsPage]
    A -->|Direct Action?| E[High Friction & Delays]
```

* **Excessive Splash Screen Delay:** A **7-second delay** on the splash screen is far too long for a coffee shop app. This should be shortened to 2-3 seconds.
* **Splash Timer Leak:** The `Timer` is not cancelled in `dispose()`, meaning if the user closes/minimizes the app before navigation triggers, it will invoke `Navigator` on an unmounted/deceased context.
* **High Contrast and Accessibility:** In `MyAccount`, the action button has a hardcoded color `Colors.amber.shade300` which contains white text. This lacks high-contrast visibility and violates WCAG contrast guidelines.
* **Profile Image Memory Leak:** Logging out does not clear the `profile_image_path` in `SharedPreferences`. If User A logs out and User B logs in, User B will see User A's profile picture until they change it.

